flowchart TD
    APP["app / repository"] --> CHOICE{"data sensitivity"}
    CHOICE -->|whole DB sensitive| SQLC["SQLCipher: encrypted Room DB"]
    CHOICE -->|few fields| FIELD["field-level TypeConverter encrypt"]
    CHOICE -->|files| FILE["EncryptedFile / AES-GCM (Ch 25)"]
    SQLC --> DEK["data key (passphrase)"]
    FIELD --> DEK
    FILE --> DEK
    DEK --> WRAP["wrapped DEK stored (ciphertext)"]
    WRAP --> KEK["Keystore KEK unwraps DEK (Ch 20) - non-extractable"]
    BACKUP["backup rules: exclude DB/files/wrapped DEK"] -.-> SQLC
    LOGOUT["logout/invalidation: clear keys (Ch 20/22)"] -.-> KEK
